{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38046","headline":"己巳年正月十二日自沙县抵邵武军将谋抚信之行到才一夕爲闽相急脚相召却请赴沙县郊外泊船偶成一篇 · 韩偓","name":"己巳年正月十二日自沙县抵邵武军将谋抚信之行到才一夕爲闽相急脚相召却请赴沙县郊外泊船偶成一篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"访戴船回郊外泊，故乡何处望天涯。\n半明半暗山村日，自落自开江庙花。\n数醆绿醅桑落酒，一瓯香沫火前茶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}